<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Amaws</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amaws</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amaws</para>
  <para style="mt1">Amaws</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Amaws chekhai, now arui khin dow 760 BC khe chekhai. Aia dow Israeluüa tut-e krawi tek Thurai lai mih risi chekhai. Nami khin khe Judauüa kowh mang dow Uzia chekhai, now Israeluüa kowh mang dow Jehuas kowh chapa Jeroboam chekhai. Aia ripra nauang ting kown mih hownia Israeluüa nauowi kaneu kown mih hai saktuak natakling taklaila kown mih lawnguan kowi krawi tek khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nami khin khen kurengma mih Israeluüa dow thawp kim hanow naiawngün kim kowi thawp pe arup pung mih ngasai sa hown tawngah khai. Tanai ni khe hangah khai rakowi kun chang miuüa dow nowng town krow dowi kowh rüla prung khai. Kureng miuüa hai nowng changra uowi miuüa dow angakma chekhai. Tara chet rah kowi ün tara nowm uowi dowi chekhai. Kawngmu kowi mih nüah klowkah büah dowi chekhai. Kawngmu kowi dow changla arup aren büah khai. Aria aret kowi dow cham owm naklak mih maru hai kiang ngakma mih maru kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Naiawng rakowi Amaws kowi Thurai tek pe mih, “Naiawng mih chowm krang uowi krang hown anikma nowngia uowi dowi; Israeluüa kowh ripra mih uang ting iawlaw khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Raiat chenchap kowi ripra hown krawkah mih 1:1-2:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Israeluüa kowh aprek hai ripra 3:1-6:14</para>
  <para style="io1">Ripra nauang ting kown mih amatra 7:1-9:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Pur prakowi Israeluüa naiung kown mih 9:11-15</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1" />Lihowng uang mih pre ning dowi rawn Israel lawnguan kowi Thurai tüng pe mih maten Amaws mih tekah khai. Amaws dow Tekoa marow kowi kowh ruapur thing miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia chekhai. Nami khin khe Uzia dow Juda pren kowi kowh mang chekhai, now Jehuas kowh chapa Jeroboam dow Israel pren kowi kowh mang chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2" />CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn hownia uang hek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:2">now Jerusalem hownia atünma tek laiklow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">Naiawng rakowi tawncher thing rah süng dow uang rüp khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:2">now Karmel hungh luk kowi kowh singh kau ün paw kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="AMO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Israeluüa riaret kowi kowh maru-uüa ripra</para>
  <para style="s">Damaskauüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:3">“Damaska marow mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:3">Aia dow lawngha chu uowi mih aküa müa hown Gilead kowi küaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:3">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4" />Hazael kowi kowh mang kimluk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:4">now Ben-Hadaduüa kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5" />Damaska kowi kowh tapplawt dow ang nakhueta pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:5">Beth-Eden kowi kowh kruitown mih kowi dow ang napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:5">Aven lawngrawi kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow ang nasaita kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:5">now Asuria kowi kowh maru-uüa dow Kir pren kowi nacham takhang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">“Gaza marow mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:6">Aia dow kua maten kowi pakuachak chi khümah now nachangla nar kownkow Edawm rut kowi cham sumah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7" />Naiawng rakowi Gaza marow kowh tap luk kowi dow ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:7">now aia kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8" />Asdawd kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi ang nasaita kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:8">Askelawn kowi kowh mang kowi paw ang napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:8">Ekrawnuüa luk kowi dow ang napar pe rut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:8">now Filistin kowi kowh sing reng tak miuüa dow nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suruüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">“Tura marow mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:9">Aia dow atainau-uüa hown kowh towah mih laikham piakta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">Aia dow kua maten kowi pakuachak chi khümah hanow nachangla nar kownkow Edawm rut kowi cham sumah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:9">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10" />Naiawng rakowi Sur kowh tap luk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:10">now aia kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">“Edawm marow mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:11">Aia dow aia kowh saksing sanara maten towta hanow saidawng hown atainau-uüa kowi krawiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">Nami klen kowi aia kowh kunma ngak mih atungma hing uowi hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:11">now aia kowh kunmarau dow aia hing tüngta hüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12" />Naiawng rakowi Teman luk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:12">now Bawzrah kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amawnuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">“Amawn kowi kowh maru-uüa mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:13">Amatni dow amatni kowh pren sünghi naphiaah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:13">Gilead süng kowi kowh apawmma mih masiuüa kowi khuek pe mu khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14" />Naiawng rakowi tasen khe kowh tasen klow iawng Rabba marow dow nakam kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:14">uowiah pakram mih liku iawng tasenra kowi aia kowh tap dow ang natowkta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:14">now aia kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün ang nakamta pe kown.<verse eid="AMO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15" />Aia kowh mang dow nacham takhang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 1:15">aia hai aia kowh pren mingkhet miuüa dow nacham takhang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2" />
  <para style="s">Moabuüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">“Moab kowi kowh maru-uüa mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:1">Amatni dow Edawm mang kowh hut ün maih kowi tikah now sürlawkah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2" />Naiawng rakowi Moab luk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:2">now Keriowt kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:2">Tasen klow hai baw tün hown pusama hown Moab kowi kowh maru-uüa dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="AMO 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3" />Aia kowh mang kowi dow ang napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:3">now aia hai aia kowh pren mingkhet miuüa maten kowi paw ang bawmta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">“Juda maru-uüa mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">Amatni dow ang kowh ari aiang nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:4">now amatni dow ang kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">Chün lak dow amatni kowh pipu-uüa iawng asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi chup büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:4">amatni paw nami tiama tawi kowi tawi mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5" />Juda luk kowi ang nauang chin pe maih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:5">now nami maih dow Jerusalem kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün nakamta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh ripra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">“Israel maru-uüa mih hing changta angak hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:6">Amatni dow nau tangka pawisa rakowi maru iunguüa kowi cham sumah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:6">now phanaikhawk achumchow rakowi ngarai miuüa kowi paw cham sumah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang naripah ngengche kown.<verse eid="AMO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7" />Amatni dow thua dinchow iawng ngarai miuüa kowi thuaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:7">now akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi riata hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:7">Pa hai chapa mih masiuüa lowk iachow hown taiua chang iang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:7">Naiawng hown ang kowh ming chimsaima mih dow piak ang büah khai.<verse eid="AMO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8" />Amatni dow arup chupra maten kowi maru uang pawngah mih tawnguat kowi changla mawk rah hanow mawkah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:8">Amatni kowh thurai chup kim kowi dow anowm nadowi mih iawk tangka hown ranla arak büah hanow khamah büah khai.<verse eid="AMO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9" />“Aw Israeluüa, sam tuak büah madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:9">Amawruüa mih sidar singh iawng akroma hai kengma singh iawng akhawtma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:9">Nachenganchepaw nami Amawruüa kowi enni pur kowi ang piakta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:9">Amatni kowh auih hai aprün paw ang piakta pe khai.<verse eid="AMO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10" />Amawruüa pren nape enni kownkow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:10">now likawm ning mowr süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang mingkhet enni khai.<verse eid="AMO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11" />Aw Israeluüa, enni kowh chauüa pungmadawng kowi nachowng risiuüa ne kown mih ang ruiah nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:11">now amatni pungmadawng hownia nachowng Nazarituüa ne kown mih ang ruiah nadowi bow?<verse eid="AMO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12" />Nachenganchepaw Nazarituüa kowi enni pe khamah arak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:12">now risiuüa iawng natek lai dowi kownkow risiuüa kowi enni peah ana khai.<verse eid="AMO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih ang nadita enni nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:13">uanh dikma mih kari kowi taküa hanow tadi nak mih iawng ang nachang enni kown.<verse eid="AMO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14" />Enni kowh iowm lang len mih maru paw kowmatia kowi nowng talawng kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:14">akürma mih maru-uüa paw namata kür bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:14">now tasen kiakma miuüa paw amatni kowh sak nowng lawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15" />Leba ap kiakma miuüa paw apowt natakla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:15">iowm lenma miuüa paw nanowng powt kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:15">now kawrnga hown kowh iowm miuüa paw amatni kowh sak nowng lawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16" />Tasen kiakma miuüa kowi kowh sak lang kraing miuüa paw nami ni khe dow napowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:16">amatni dow towla rutchün khawkleng hüah hanow napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 2:16">Ang CHAKRAMANG, mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kunmarau mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1" />Aw Israeluüa, Aigupta pren hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla mih krungchakuüa, enni vüi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow sünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih,<verse eid="AMO 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2" />“Lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten pungmadawng hownia ang lang klo enni mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:2">tawkche enni dow chang lup ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:2">Naiawng rakowi ang narip enni kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risi kowh lup</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3" />Rik tachiaah dowi matchang pre ia cham taiua kowi mih uowi bow?<verse eid="AMO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4" />Ka mak chak dowi matchang kaurawng kowi krangsi hek tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:4">Ka mak chak dowi rawn puk lak kowi krangsi ngir kakat tak bow?<verse eid="AMO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5" />Kawm uakling dawng khe thela pe chak dowi matchang uakling uang kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:5">Tawngpaw uang kakah dowi matchang aiawnglowma leng taklowt kown bow?<verse eid="AMO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6" />Marow kowi ta baw tün now takrow dowi mih maru uowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:6">CHAKRAMANG uang pe tingah dowi matchang marow kowi phih uang ting kown bow?<verse eid="AMO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow lowra lup aia nachang kown now risiuüa kowi rik tüng pe reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:7">aia kowh kamrütra anar risiuüa kowi rik tek pe dowi matchang tawngpaw aia chang dowi.<verse eid="AMO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8" />Krangsi hek now mia chow kram dowi mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:8">CHAKRAMANG Thurai pe tekah laiklow now risi iawng tek lai dowi mih amia chow uowi?<verse eid="AMO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9" />Asdawd hai Aigupta kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim maten kowi uowi miuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:9">“Samari kowi kowh hungh kowi takua talawm büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">Israeluüa mün khowt chow ngah mih mü büah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:9">now mün khowt chow tachang nowng büah mih sam mü büah madiah,” padow kowtek pe büa diah.<verse eid="AMO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10-11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Israeluüa mih achinawmma tuk uowi dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:10-11">amatni dow maru-uüa hownia krawi rupah mih uanh amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi krümah büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:10-11">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh pren dow ransu-uüa nauang umta lut kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:10-11">Amatni kowh tahang müa tap dow ransu-uüa napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:10-11">now amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowh krümah mih uanh ransu-uüa napawta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 3:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Krangsi mak ruapur khe nakrawi lawngah kownkow ruapur thing mih kawikrawi chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:12">akhawk hut pre dung chow nadowi now paramkui pasekchow krawi ka khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">Nami powm iawng Samari kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa dow akekchow naplai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:12">Amatni dow phangbek hai uankhup asekchow hown nata lat kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:13">“Sünta, Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi kaneuma nauowi kownkow tek pe diah.<verse eid="AMO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14" />Amatni kowh angak rakowi Israel kowi ang naripah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:14">Nami khin khe Bethel kowi kowh phuchuara ün ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:14">Nahanow phuchuara kowi kowh anang ün natalet kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:14">now krawng kowi nadowh kown towbowt.<verse eid="AMO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15" />Chungrau khin khe kowh uowi rah kim ang napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:15">now satma khin khe kowh uowi rah kim ün paw ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:15">Nasai sah hown kowh tawngah mih kim ün ang napiakta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 3:15">now kri kraingma mih kim ün paw ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:15">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1" />Aw Samari hungh luk kowi kowh masiuüa hawmh, sünta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:1">enni dow Basan kowi kowh chiama hawmh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:1">Ngarai miuüa kowi enni changah nowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:1">now akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi enni towkah krat khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:1">Nami klen kowi enni huauüa kowi enni tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:1">“Uang pawla anging arak dit ba,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih aiamat ming chimsaima mih hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:2">“Enni luk kowi phih nauang ting ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:2">Nami khin khe mih auowk müa hown nauowk enni hanow maru naküngla enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:2">bowkbowk kowi kuai hown nauowk enni hanow naküngla enni kown.<verse eid="AMO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3" />Enni mih marow tap piak mih rah hownia nauang lawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:3">now Hermawn hungh prakowi ang nacham kuakta enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:3">Ang CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="AMO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4" />“Bethel kowi kowkowi hanow kowchang ngak kown enni nau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:4">naiawng rakowi tarü büah hanow kowchang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:4">now Gilgal kowi kowkowi hanow kowchang büah küng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:4">Rau towng enni kowh phuchua müa uanh pawla büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:4">now sum ni kowi pakat chi hamüt bak kowi pabak mih uanh pawla hanow kowkowi büa diah.<verse eid="AMO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5" />Enni nachangla bawri kown nau rakowi enni uang pawla uanap khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:5">Enni nachangla owrow kownkow ang kük enni mih lak-e hu enni uang pawla uanap reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">Naiawng nachang kown mih lainowmma enni nauah mih chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6" />“Ang tut-e enni pauang cham plan lah pakowh marow towng kowi ang towk enni hawm khawr khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:6">now kua towng kowi paw chakkham khawr hown ang tow enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:6">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e enni uang plan dowi chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7" />Cha ngen khin sum la dowi rawn ang taingta enni uang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:7">Tawngbak khe lowk mih marow kowi uang kowi ang pe uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:7">now akeng mih marow kowi dow uang kowi ang pe uangah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">Lowk mih üa dow ka uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:7">now alowk mih üa dow ka uang dowi rakowi keu khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">Naiawng rakowi ka uang dowi mih üa kowi dow tawng iawng mih uih-ak paw phaw dowi.<verse eid="AMO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8" />Tui rakowi pre sum kua maru-uüa mih iowm se iowm se akeng kua kowi krawi kowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:8">Tawkche duh pat ka kham tui büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:8">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e enni uang plan dowi.<verse eid="AMO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9" />“Enni kowh uih-ak rawng ün sat den hown ang pe keuta enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:9">now enni kowh uih-ien pantawn hai grep rawng paw ang piakta enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:9">Enni kowh uidut singh hai kanrawn singh paw plawng hawmh chata enni bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:9">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e enni uang plan dowi chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10" />“Aigupta pren kowi ang kowchin pe makowng hawi iawng enni tut-e paw ang uang chin enni makowng hawi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:10">tasenra kowi enni kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi ang bawmta enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">Enni kowh kawrnga ün paw ang pawta enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:10">now enni kowh siphaiuüa tangbung khupra paw uak su namma ang changta enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e enni uang plan dowi chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11" />“Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi ang piakah iawng enni kowh marow ang piakta enni ne khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:11">Enni dow maih hownia kowh khowngah mih singh klowkchow lün pluplup mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:11">Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e enni uang plan dowi.<verse eid="AMO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12" />“Naiawng kowh aw Israel, naiawngün mih lup en hown ang nachang ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:12">Naiawng rakowi aw Israel, en kowh Thurai pur kowi naiowng kownkow kamrüt diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13" />Aia dow hungma mawngma hai li thawp miia chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:13">aia dow aia kowh saktuak mih lusa maru kowi pe tukah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">Aia dow anowi kowi aiiu thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 4:13">now hungma mawngma luk kowi mang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">Aia kowh ming dow CHAKRAMANG mukuang siphaiuüa kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1" />Aw Israeluüa, enni lawnguan kowi ang tekah mih kar meng sünta büa diah.<verse eid="AMO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2" />“Israel, en dow malauüa tadowklowt mih iawng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:2">en dow tim khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">En dow katpaw nowng rü dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:2">en dow krawng kowi takuak hüah towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">En kowi dow miapaw krüng en kown mih uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Israel kowi kowh marow hownia siphai 1,000 ia cham tarü tasen mih dow 100 iachow taih nauang plan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:3">now akeng mih marow hownia 100 ia cham tarü tasen mih dow hamüt iachow taih nauang plan kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sing kown nau now CHAKRAMANG tut plan diah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4-5" />Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:4-5">“Bethel, Gilgal hai Ber-Seba kowi hangkow kowi büah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:4-5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Gilgal kowi kowh maru-uüa dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:4-5">now Bethel dow napiak kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:4-5">Naiawng rakowi ang tut-e uang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:4-5">nahanow enni nasing kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6" />Naiawng rakowi aw Israeluüa, enni nasingla kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowkowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:6">Naiawng nadowi now maih iawng dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi aia nalün kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:6">Nami maih dow nakamta enni bowk kown chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:6">nami maih dow Bethel kowi miapaw nowng mit kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7" />Enni dow tara nowm kowi enni piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:7">now anowm kowi dow krawng kowi enni kuakah khai.<verse eid="AMO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow Rauleng hai Iakleng krek thawp miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:8">Aia dow aiiu kowi anowi thawpah hanow ni kowi uar thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">Aia dow sata tui kowi hawah hanow süngkangma kowi khükah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:8">Aia ming dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9" />Aia dow akürma miuüa luk kowi uang pawla pe piakra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:9">now amatni kowh kim aiukma mih ün amaisang piakta pe reng.<verse eid="AMO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10" />Angak kowi kingküa mih maru kowi enni suiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:10">now tara chetra kowi kowh tek lainowm miuüa kowi enni toah khai.<verse eid="AMO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi enni changah nowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:11">now amatni kowh luprak paw kür hown enni paw pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">Naiawng rakowi hua aiuk aiukma mih hown enni thawp kim chepaw enni naka uowiah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:11">Grep rawng klangiung klangiungma enni ien chepaw enni naka khamah atui kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12" />Mün khowt chow enni kowh angak hu mih hai mün khowt chow enni kowh aprek kraing mih ang tuk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:12">Maru iunguüa luk kowi enni chang nowng hai enni cha büm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:12">Ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi tara chetra kowi tara nowm enni chet pe dowi.<verse eid="AMO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13" />Naiawng mih khin dow angak khin chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:13">Naiawng rakowi chanlaima mih maru dow nami khin khe rarimma lang uowi phülü khai.<verse eid="AMO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14" />Naiawng rakowi enni nasingla kownkow angak prakowi mang dowi kowi aiung prakowi mang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:14">Nahanow enni tekah mih iawng lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai natawi uowila enni kown.<verse eid="AMO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15" />Angak kowi suiah büa diah, now aiung kowi nauah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:15">Marow kowi kowh tara chetra kowi tara nowm chetah büah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:15">Naiawng che enni chang hanow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai nasana enni chepaw naia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:15">Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta lat miuüa luk kowi aia nasanaah chepaw naia.<verse eid="AMO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">“Marow kowi kowh akuangma mih rah maten kowi maru nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:16">now tiama towng kowi naphek kaucha büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">Amatni dow üa lup chang miuüa kowi paw nahawla büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:16">now nanguk nakar kownkow ngaah miuüa hown nape taiua karah kown.<verse eid="AMO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17" />Grep krum maten kowi paw enni nanguk nakar kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni pungmadawng iawng ang nauang len hanow ang nauang rip enni kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:17">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18" />
    <char style="w">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</char> khi kown sakkrowng miuüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:18">Tawngplawng kowchow nami ni nakhi kown enni tuk prüa khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:18">Nami ni dow ni iung nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:18">ni ngak chowtaih enni vüi naown kown.<verse eid="AMO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19" />Nami ni dow maiawng naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:19">krangsi rut hownia powt now tawm pur kowi cham towm mih iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:19">now kowmatia kim kimbang kowi tane khe rua chawtah mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="AMO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ni dow ni iung nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:20">nami ni dow ni ngak chowtaih naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:20">Nami ni dow aiung ditchow paw nauowi kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:20">nami ni dow angak churma naown kown.<verse eid="AMO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:21">“Enni kowh kawngmu pawi ün ang sui, ang nau dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:21">Enni kowh takua talawmra mapaw ang awmrawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22" />Tikah mih uanap enni uang ap ang chepaw ang nahawt paw enni kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:22">now uih-ak uanap enni uang ap ang chepaw ang hawt paw enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:22">Aiuk akauma mih tawncher hown taking tasangra uanap pawi enni chang chepaw naia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:22">tawkche nami prakowi ngeu khowm ang nangeu enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23" />Enni kowh meng klow rimta prang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:23">Enni kowh taraw tün ün ang nasünta enni kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24" />Nami lak-e tara nowm dow aw tui iawng pacham hawr lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 5:24">now lainowm dow achowngma hawr mih tui iawng pacham hawr lah.<verse eid="AMO 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25" />“Aw Israel kowi kowh maru-uüa, süngrüp süngkangma kowi likawm ning enni uowi mih khin khe asadua hai akeng uanap ang kük enni dowi chekhai. <verse eid="AMO 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26" />Tawkche enni matia vüi enni thawpah mih mang Sakut rup hai enni chupah mih krek Kauan rup kowi enni kawtla khai. <verse eid="AMO 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27" />Naiawng rakowi Damaska klen kowi ang nacham sa enni kown, now nakowi mih enni nacham takhang kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1" />Zaiawn hungh kowi kowh asowrma uowi miuüa hai Samari hungh kowi kowh thaulangma uowi miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:1">chenchap maten kowi kowh lang iuk mih chenchap, Israel pren kowi kowh Israeluüa sakowmah mih maru iukuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:1">enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!<verse eid="AMO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2" />Kalne marow kowi kowkowi büah hanow kowsam mü büah madiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:2">nami hownia Hamat marow aiukma mih kowi kowkowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:2">now Filistinuüa kowh Gat marow kowi kowkowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:2">Pai iawngün pren lak-e Israel pren hai Juda pren lang iung khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:2">Kowbüah kowh pren lak-e enni kowh pren lang iuk khai bow?<verse eid="AMO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3" />Phih nauang ting kown mih ni kowi enni henta khowk padow enni ka tuak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:3">Nachenganchepaw damra iawng dow enni krui pren khai.<verse eid="AMO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4" />Enni luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:4">Enni dow ngasai sah hown kowh thawpah mih mawk rah kowi enni mawk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:4">now phangbek luk kowi asowrma mawk se enni iai kow khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:4">Enni kowh ruapur hai chia kowi kowh anga lang iung mih enni cha khai.<verse eid="AMO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5" />Tep taraw hanow enni tek meng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:5">now mang David iawng dow tingteng taraw achaing achaing enni thawp khai.<verse eid="AMO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6" />Grep tui dow bia tek mawp chi enni kham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:6">now paingbawng lang nam iung mih enni phawk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:6">Tawkche Israel pren piak mih enni sak kowi rau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7" />Naiawng rakowi akeng pren kowi nacham takhang kown miuüa pungmadawng kowi nacham rik takhang kown mih dow enni chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:7">Nami khin khe dow enni kowh pawi chak hai asowrma mawk se taiai mih khin nachur bowt kown.<verse eid="AMO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh bawrira CHAKRAMANG sui mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai aiamat ming hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:8">“Jakawb kowh bawrira hai akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow ang sui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:8">Naiawng rakowi enni kowh marow hai enni kowh uowi mih srui akeng chenchapuüa kowi ang nacham peta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9" />Ta lat mih maru hamüt ia pakimchow kowi uowi chepaw nakowng büah kown. <verse eid="AMO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10" />Nami kung kowi kowng miuüa uak dow nacham chengah kownkow amatni kowh tasin taken miuüa nauang paw kown, now nami kim kowi akeng mih uowi ne tak chünchü natukla kownkow, “En klen kowi uowi ne tak bow?” Padow nalüntaah kown. Nami khin khe nami kim kowi hawt uowi mih naklangah kown mih, “Uowi dowi bowt,” napa kown. Now uang pawah mih maru natek pe kown mih, “Hang pawpan. CHAKRAMANG ming khowm padow hang rük,” napape kown.<verse eid="AMO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11" />CHAKRAMANG pe ana hanow kim aiuk aiukma mih natapiak nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:11">now asowm asowmchow mih kim paw adi asekma nachowng kown.<verse eid="AMO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12" />Thia luk kowi kawrnga iowm kakat tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:12">Thia luk kowi chiala hown thawn laih mih uowi ne bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:12">Nachenganchepaw enni dow bualama rakowi tara nowm kowi changla ket khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:12">now anowm sung kowi dow akhakma enni changah khai.<verse eid="AMO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13" />Lodebar kua achalachow mih enni nowngta khai rakowi enni awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:13">Now, “Anging matia kür hown Karnaim kua paw anging nowngta khai,” padow enni chang bawri khai.<verse eid="AMO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14" />Naiawng rakowi lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:14">“Israeluüa low, nakingküa enni kownkow ang nauang chin enni chenchap lowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:14">Nami chenchap dow tawngphak kowi kowh Hamat marow hownia nachang enni nowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 6:14">now mrawkphak kowi kowh Araba lawngrawi mowr nachang enni nowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7" />
  <para style="s">Plawng, maih hai akhai müa leng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih maiawng mukmang kowi uang tüng ang khai: Mang kowh tawncher vüi ki ngenta pram kung kowi awr ta awm mih pram maru nakrawi ngen kown mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih uang chin pe plawng hawmh khai. <verse eid="AMO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2" />Naiawngün plawng hawmh mih uangah hanow nami pren kowi kowh pram uowi mih maten asaima uang chata khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang awr tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:2">“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, lawt anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:2">Nadowi now tawng iawng chow Jakawb nasing kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:2">Aia dow khowt sowm mih,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Thurai planta sak now tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:3">“Pai iawng dow own dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih mukmang kowi maiawng uang plan tüng ang lowk iawk: Aia maru-uüa kowi naripah kownkow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih maih kowi hawah khai. Nami maih dow sata tui khowm padow ia kangta khai, now bawn kowi ün paw krawi kamah khai. <verse eid="AMO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang awr tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:5">“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, naiawngün sakrauma hown taingta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:5">Nadowi now tawng iawng chow Jakawb nasing kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:5">Aia dow khowt sowm mih,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6" />Nakhowk khe paw CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih planta sak now tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:6">“Pai iawng pat paw own dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG mih mukmang kowi maiawng uang plan tüng ang lowk iawk: Aia dow akhai müa leng dowkma akhai müa hown kowh thawpah mih kimbang ria kowi iowng mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="AMO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8" />Aia tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:8">“Amaws, tawng chow en khi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:8">Ang klangah mih, “Akhai müa leng,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:8">Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:8">“Mami leng dow ang maru Israeluüa mih atengma mih tap iawng nadowi pami tüng müa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:8">amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni kowi dow ang nalawtah kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9" />Isak chuprek chaprekuüa kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ang napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:9">Israeluüa kowh akeng mih chupiiara ün paw ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:9">Now Jeroboam chuprek chaprekuüa kowi saidawng hown ang nakingküaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaws hai Amazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10" />Akung kowi nami tawi tata now Bethel kowi kowh uamow Amazia mih Israel mang Jeroboam kowi kowphowng pe satang khai. Aia kowtek pe mih, “Amaws mih nakingküa en kownkow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi sangkrang khai. Aia kowh laiklow dow prenchakuüa mapaw nowng kham dowi bowt. <verse eid="AMO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11" />Amaws tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:11">“‘Jeroboam dow saidawng hown nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:11">Israel dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang ngengche kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="AMO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12" />Nakhowk khe Amazia tek pe Amaws mih, “Amaws, Juda pren kowi kowpowt prang. Nakowi phai risi iawng krawi tek lai now en matia chak kowkrawi kram bowt. <verse eid="AMO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13" />Bethel kowi risi iawng hang krawi tek lai tham bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami dow mang kowh uowi rah hai Israeluüa kowh chupiia rah chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="AMO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14" />Amazia kowi Amaws klangah mih, “Ang dow risi nadowi chowdiah, now risi kowh chapa paw nadowi chowdiah. Ang dow ruapur thing mih hai uidut singh mingkhet mih taih chowdiah. <verse eid="AMO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15" />Nachenganchepaw ruapur thing rah hownia CHAKRAMANG uang haw ang now tek ang mih, ‘Kowkowi now ang maru Israeluüa tut-e risi iawng kowtek lai diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="AMO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16" />Naiawng rakowi en mih kawmat CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah. En tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:16">“‘Risi iawng Israeluüa kowi kingküa mih laiklow hang krawi tek tham bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:16">now Isak chuprek chaprekuüa kowi kingküala mih laiklow paw hang krawi chia tham bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:17">‘Marow kowi en kowh masi nachowng chawkkrawma kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:17">now tasenra kowi en kowh chauüa nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:17">En kowh krawng bawn dow khaiah hanow akeng miuüa kowi naret pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:17">now asür alawkma mih pren kowi en matia dow nacham kowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 7:17">Israel kowi dow amatni pren hownia nakhümla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 7:17">aia dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang ngengche kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="AMO 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mukmang kowi kowh uih min</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih tüng ang mukmang lowk iawk. Nami mukmang kowi dow ang khi uidut uih min aem khai. <verse eid="AMO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2" />Aia lünta ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:2">“Amaws, tawng chow en khi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:2">Ang klangah mih, “Ang khi uidut uih min aem,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 8:2">Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:2">“Mami uih dow ang maru Israeluüa kowi naripah kown mih tüng müa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:2">amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni kowi dow ang lawtah kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3" />Nami ni khe dow mang kim kowi kowh meng mih nachowng kar meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:3">Lowra kowi uak kangowh nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:3">Naiawngün uak dow rarimma marow uat kowi nacham pawla kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:3">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa chang nowng chang powng mih sung</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4" />Akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi chang nowng miuüa low, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:4">ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi chang nowng miuüa low, sünta büa diah.<verse eid="AMO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5" />Enni tek mih, “A-i kowh cha nowng sumla bowt kownkow matawng khe chow Lacher Pawi nakhowk kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:5">A-i kowh püm nowng sumla bowt kownkow matawng khe chow Tanai Ni nachur kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:5">Cha khai müa tawng a-i nasowmta bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:5">uanh sung a-i napünta bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:5">now kuanla kown mih set hown a-i nakhai uanh bowt kown.<verse eid="AMO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi tai tangka hown a-i naranah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:6">ka dowi miuüa kowi phanaikhawk atawngchow hown a-i naranah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:6">now püm pli ün a-i nasum pe bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:7">“Amatni chang mih srui mapaw ang tamata kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8" />Pren mih nachü hanow pren kowi kowh maru maten nanguk nakar kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:8">Tui lawt khe kowh Nail aw tui iawng pün lai sut lai paprenma naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Nami ni khe dow sat downg thüm khe sat kowi ang nape kupta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:9">now ni ür thüm khe lusa kowi aiiuma ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="AMO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10" />Enni kowh pawi maten dow prüa iiara ang nachangta enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:10">enni kowh meng klow maten dow nguk klow kar klow ang nachangta enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:10">now ang nape khup enni sala uan hanow lu kiama ang nachang enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">Nami khin dow chapa uowi lowkchow mih kowng khe kowh prüa iiara khin iawng ang nachang enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:10">now achur khe pat prüa iiara ahuma hown enni nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nakhawr Thurai lai kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Akhin nauang ting kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:11">pren kowi ang nauang chin pe khown kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:11">Nami khown dow tui khawr hawm khawr khown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:11">nami dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow khawr mih khown chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12" />Nami khin khe satlawt hownia satkup mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:12">tawngphak hownia mrawkphak mowr chi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:12">CHAKRAMANG laiklow iowm se iowm se maru nakrawi cham kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:12">Tawkche naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13" />Nami ni khe dow klangiungma mih malauüa hawmh khowm padow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sakkrai hown namaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:13">now akürma mih klanguüa hawmh paw CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sakkrai hown namaw kown.<verse eid="AMO 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14" />Samari kowi kowh arup ming hown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:14">‘Aw Dan, en masing thurai ming hown ang takham khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 8:14">aw Ber-Seba en masing thurai ming hown ang takham khowk,’ pahai takham miuüa natim kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:14">Amatni dow mapaw nanowng rü kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh piakra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1" />Nami kung kowi dow phuchuara ria kowi CHAKRAMANG iowng mih ang khi khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:1">“Amaws, Thurai chup kim kimchüng maten aluk prakowi krawi sam bawp madiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:1">Kimluk mih nachü hanow pacham tapiak lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:1">now nakowi kowh maru maten lu luk kowi pacham iu dowh lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:1">Nakhowk khe kowh tawi kowng dowi miuüa kowi dow tasenra kowi ang nakowngta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:1">miapaw nanowng powt kown nadowi.<verse eid="AMO 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2" />Amatni mih makownguüa uowi rah abüpma thaiah mih kowi cham uowi chepaw nami hownia ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:2">now kuang dawng alowngma kowi cham uowi büah chepaw nami hownia ang nauang klala kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3" />Karmel hungh chem kowi cham tapet büah chepaw ang nakrawi chamah hanow ang nakrawi khümah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:3">Sata thingh kowi cham tapetta ang büah chepaw nakowi nahawt chawtah kownkow rua kowi ang napeah ana kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4" />Ransu-uüa khümla kowh akeng pren kowi cham takhang chepaw amatni dow nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:4">amatni kowi nakowngta kownkow nakowi kowh saidawng kowi ang napeah ana kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:4">Amatni kowi ang nakrawi müah reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:4">tawkche amatni kowi ang napeah iungra kownkow nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:4">amatni kowi ang napiakah kownkow chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai che pren kowi kakta khowk now pren dow chü reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:5">Aia che towpta büt now paprenma dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh Nail aw tui iawng pün lai sut lai phaw reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:5">Naiawng rakowi pren kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten dow aprüa aiia hown uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow lusa luk kowi aküm müa powm iawng mukuang mih thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:6">now nami luk kowi dow aia thawp kim khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:6">Aia dow sata tui kowi hawah hanow süngkangma kowi khükah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:6">Naiawngün maten chang miia ming dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:7">“Aw Israeluüa, Ethiawpia pren kowi kowh maru-uüa hown enni tatu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:7">Aigupta pren hownia ang uang lawtla enni iawng Kret pren hownia Filistinuüa kowi paw ang uang lawtla nadowi bow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:7">now Kir pren hownia Assuriauüa kowi paw ang uang lawtla nadowi bow?<verse eid="AMO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8" />Mami pren angak kangowh mih luk kowi ang kowh mik uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:8">Lusa kowi mami pren mih ang napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:8">Nachenganchepaw Jakawb chenchapuüa kowi bowkbowk pat dow ang piakta dowi tham.<verse eid="AMO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9" />Ang nape ana hanow per hown kowh krap cha iawng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi Israeluüa kowi ang nakrapah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:9">Nami khin khe dow maru ngakuüa mih natawi takrap bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:9">naiawng hown maru ngakuüa kowi dow ang nahenah kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10" />Ang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru ngakuüa dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:10">‘Tawng angak paw a-i luk kowi nauang ting kown nadowi,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:10">Tawkche amatni bowkbowk kowi saidawng hown nasaiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="AMO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG laikham sar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami ni khe dow mang David kowh kim tim khowk mih ang narüngah iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:11">nami ni khe dow apiaknama mih arah ang nakrawi rawah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:11">now alai kowh iawng ang nachangah iawk kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12" />Edawmuüa kowh ta lat mih pren Israeluüa napowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:12">now ang kowh pahai ang khamah mih akeng chenchap maten kowh pren paw napowngta büah kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:12">Nami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:12">now naiawngün lup dow aia mih nachang kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:13">“Akhin nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">Nami khin khe dow luprak ahuma naphaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:13">cha ngen chur dowi rawn cha sawt khin nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">Grep uih küa chur dowi rawn achowk khin nauang ting kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:13">aiuk aiukma mih hungh hownia ahuma naka grep tui sar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:13">now asowm asowmchow mih hungh maten dow grep tui hown nalim kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14" />Ang maru Israeluüa kowi cham takhang mih rah hownia ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:14">amatni dow tapiak khowk mih marow narawah büah hanow nakowi nauowi büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">Amatni dow nachang grep krum hanow nakhamah atui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:14">nachang kheti bakan büah hanow nami uih mih nacha büah kown.<verse eid="AMO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15" />Amatni pren kowi kowh singh iawng Israeluüa kowi ang nachowkah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="AMO 9:15">ang peah mih pren hownia amatni kowi miapaw nachawiah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">Mami laiklow dow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="AMO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9" />
</usx>